// matrix, and Q is the number of output channels. The matrix elements are each float32Numbers. The array
// is organized as follows:
// array = [e11, e12, ..., e1P, e21, e22, ..., e2P, ..., eQ1, eQ2, ..., eQP, e1, e2, ..., eQ]

